<p>While rampaging, you slam up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> adjacent opponents, stunning them for 2 turns and damaging them for between <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100">41, 56, 67, 76, 85</acronym> and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100">83, 112, 134, 153, 170</acronym> physical damage. Your first slam of at least two opponents increases the rampage duration by 1.</p><p>Damage increases with your Physical Power.</p>